 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Multiplicativity of the Artin–Schreier sheaves",
 "statement": "The sheaf $\\mathcal L_{\\psi,f}$ is lisse of rank one on $X_0$, and\n\n$$\n\\mathcal L_{\\psi,f}\\otimes\\mathcal L_{\\psi,g}\\cong\\mathcal L_{\\psi,f+g},\\qquad\n(\\mathcal L_{\\psi,f})^{-1}\\cong\\mathcal L_{\\psi,-f}\\cong\\mathcal L_{\\psi^{-1},f}.\n$$\n\nThis is the second assertion of [lem-fd-as-characters].",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-fourier-transform/sk-lem-as-properties/lem-fd-as-lisse.md",
  "place": "node lem-fd-as-lisse, order 2685"
 },
 "stmt_deps": [
  "lem-fd-as-characters"
 ],
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "This is immediate from the decomposition of [lem-fd-as-characters] (the tensor and inverse of the rank-one isotypic components correspond to the sums $f+g$ and $-f$ of the functions).",
   "uses": [
    "lem-fd-as-characters"
   ],
   "elementary": false
  }
 ],
